# Halo 2 (4D530064), Nova. Built from the generic survey
# 1790946979-titleroutes2-3257388 (lane.titleroutes2, read 2026-10-02).
# Read from its route-frames, not guessed:
#   boot20 (062313): white flash; boot40/booted (062335, 062357): the title,
#     "PRESS START TO CONTINUE".
#   cycle 1 (062402 START / 062408 A): START -> CHOOSE PROFILE, "Create New
#     Profile" lit; A -> PROFILE NAME keyboard, default "Halo0001".
#   cycle 2 (062413 START / 062419 A): START = Done -> the main menu,
#     CAMPAIGN lit; A -> CAMPAIGN OPTIONS, "New Campaign" lit.
#   cycle 3 (062424 START / 062431 A): START -> SELECT LEVEL ("The
#     Heretic"); A -> CHOOSE DIFFICULTY, Normal lit.
#   cycle 4 (062437 START / 062442 A): START -> the Halo 2 loading card;
#     black.
#   cycles 5-7 (062448..062517): black, then the Heretic prologue cutscene
#     (High Charity, the Gravemind's tower); START/A do not skip it.
#   cycle 8 START (062523): "Updating profile... done", the Armory: the
#     Chief in the calibration ring, the Gunnery Sergeant to the right.
#     Live. "One Size Fits All" chapter title on the next frame.
#   cycles 8-14: START = GAME PAUSED (Continue lit; objective "Follow the
#     Gunnery Sergeant's instructions"), A = Continue. From 062604 the top
#     light of the ring is lit red and the tip "Use [RIGHT] to look up"
#     stays up for the rest of the window: the survey only sent RX and LY.
#   play (062639..062754): the same frame four times.
# The survey saved a profile (4D530064 harvested), so the next run may
# list "Halo0001" on CHOOSE PROFILE. START and A both select on these
# menus, so a lit Halo0001 skips the keyboard and the path shortens by one
# press; the guard pairs (pause + Continue) absorb that.
# So: 10 START/A cycles (play at 8, two guard pairs), then a calibration
# block: look up, look down, look up again (whichever light the ring asks
# for next), A to keep the look setting, a step forward, X; a frame after
# every leg so the replay maps what the Armory asks next. No START after
# the mark. In play A is jump, B melee, X action/reload: all harmless.
# Replay 1 (1790948386-titleroutes2-3358105, ref 93203cee0a): same path
# (CHOOSE PROFILE listed Halo0001 but kept "Create New Profile" lit); the
# Armory on cycle 7's A. The look block passed the test, but its 1.5 s
# holds left the look INVERTED ("Updating profile... done" at 064331, then
# RY max = up) and the view pegged at the ceiling for the whole window.
# HELD Nova nav session (lane.titleroutes2 s2, 07:24-07:36 PDT,
# ~/hakux-work/nav/halo-2.returning-20261002T072440/, 47 frames):
#   - A presses skip parts of the Heretic prologue; with no presses it
#     runs well past a minute.
#   - the test is two rounds of "Use [RIGHT] to look up" (top light) then
#     "look down" (bottom light); each light goes dark when the crosshair
#     crosses it. Full-throw single taps (nav.py's ~0.4 s round trip) move
#     the view ~160 px; a 20000 tap barely moves it. Up taps x2, down x2,
#     up x3, down x3 passed both rounds non-inverted, then "Updating
#     profile... done".
#   - after it the Armory is free-roam under "Follow the Gunnery Sergeant's
#     instructions": the Sergeant walks off toward a corridor, the doors
#     show red locks, and ~3 min of walking and waiting found no trigger.
# So the open-loop route ends in the Armory either way. Reaching Cairo
# Station needs screen-aware driving (drive.py) or a save past the Armory;
# this file stays a DRAFT, its steps as replay 1 ran them.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
shot booted
repeat 10 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
repeat 3 {
    axis RY min
    wait 1.5
    axis RY mid
    wait 2
    shot look-up
    axis RY max
    wait 1.5
    axis RY mid
    wait 2
    shot look-down
    press A
    wait 2
    shot answer-a
    axis LY min
    wait 2
    axis LY mid
    press X
    wait 2
    shot step
}
mark gameplay               # CHECK: the Armory's look test passed, no pause panel
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 3
    shot fwd
    press X
    wait 0.5
    axis RX max
    wait 0.5
    axis RX mid
    wait 2.5
    shot right
    press A
    wait 1
    axis RX min
    wait 0.9
    axis RX mid
    wait 2.5
    shot left
    axis LY mid
    press B
    wait 1
    axis RY min
    wait 0.4
    axis RY mid
    wait 1
    axis RY max
    wait 0.4
    axis RY mid
    wait 1
    shot look
}
